{"id":389152,"name":"BIOBALANCE Dermasoothe Soothing Facial Cleansing Gel 250ml","slug":"biobalance-demasoothe-soothing-facial-cleansing-gel-250ml","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/buybetter.ng\/product\/biobalance-demasoothe-soothing-facial-cleansing-gel-250ml\/","sku":"8697711701016","short_description":"<p>A soothing, soap\u2011free cleansing gel that gently removes impurities, calms sensitive skin, and supports the skin barrier\u2014perfect for daily use on reactive or easily irritated complexions.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"651\">Calm, cleanse, and protect sensitive or reactive skin with <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"390\">BIOBALANCE Dermasoothe Soothing Facial Cleansing Gel<\/strong>. This soap\u2011free, oil\u2011free gel is formulated to remove dirt, impurities and makeup gently\u2014without stripping moisture or leaving residue that can clog pores. It\u2019s designed specifically for skin that needs extra care, yet still wants a thorough, everyday cleanse.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"1039\">Key soothing actives like <strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"692\">Bisabolol<\/strong> support the skin\u2019s barrier and help reduce redness, stinging, and sensitivity. A complementary <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"810\">amino acid complex<\/strong> boosts the skin\u2019s tolerance to irritants, while moisturizers such as <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"940\">glycerin, aloe vera, allantoin, panthenol, and vitamin E<\/strong> help retain moisture and soothe the skin during cleansing.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1220\">The result is a cleanser that leaves skin feeling fresh, balanced, and comfortable\u2014ideal for morning and evening use on skin prone to irritation or dryness from harsher cleansers.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1238\">Key benefits<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1598\">\n<li data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1291\">\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1275\">Gentle but effective cleansing<\/strong> for daily use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1379\">\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1329\">Reduces redness and sensitivity<\/strong>, thanks to Bisabolol and supportive ingredients<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1407\">Supports skin barrier<\/strong> with amino acids and hydrating agents<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1533\">\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1533\"><strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1481\">Soap\u2011free, oil\u2011free formula<\/strong> that rinses cleanly with no pore\u2011clogging residue<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1598\">\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1598\"><strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1598\">Suitable for sensitive, reactive, or easily irritated skin<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1614\">How to use<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1771\">Use daily. Massage gently onto wet face and neck twice a day, then rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water and pat dry.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1771\">This simple routine ensures your skin is clean, soothed, and ready for the rest of your skincare steps\u2014without the tight, dry feeling some cleansers leave behind.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1151500","regular_price":"1151500","sale_price":"1151500","price_range":null,"currency_code":"NGN","currency_symbol":"\u20a6","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"\u20a6","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8358;<\/span>11,515.00<\/span> <small class=\"woocommerce-price-suffix\">NG<\/small